<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Whether the slot&apos;s shader reads the normal-map layout -- ``ps-t0`` normal map,
``ps-t1`` diffuse, ``ps-t2`` lightmap, re-slotted by ``ORFix`` -- in which case the
mod&apos;s ``ps-t0`` / ``ps-t1`` are shifted up, a flat normal map is created on ``ps-t0``
